Instructions for this repo are shared across all coding agents and live in
`AGENTS.md` at the repo root. Read it before making changes, along with
`docs/state.md` (work currently in flight — update it before you finish),
`docs/architecture.md`, and `docs/conventions.md`.

Key rules: backend is ESM TypeScript (relative imports end in `.js`); every
Express route needs `requireRoles(...)` plus a club-ownership check for
non-admin roles; validation is Zod from `backend/src/utils/validators.ts`;
frontend uses TanStack Query, shadcn primitives from `@/components/ui`, and
Tailwind v4 semantic tokens rather than hardcoded colours. There is no test
suite — verify with `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run build`.
